From: havok2-htwo <havok2-htwo@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sat, 17 Oct 2026 03:37:08 +0200
Subject: [PATCH 2/2] serve: short reads review fixes - pool overflow off the
 host thread, staging at start, verify/fault hooks, T0c gates (opt-in
 STRATA_SR_CKPT_WARM=1, STRATA_SR_CKPT_LATE=1, STRATA_SR_NODRAIN=1)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 include/strata/program/short_reads.hpp |  39 +++++-
 src/program/generate.cpp               | 168 ++++++++++++++++++++++---
 tests/program/short_reads_test.cpp     |  18 ++-
 3 files changed, 203 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

